WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 47=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:43.310 --> 01:44.230
Come catch me!

01:45.040 --> 01:45.920
Be careful.

01:46.904 --> 01:49.120
- It's Chinese New Year!
- It's Chinese New Year!

01:55.200 --> 01:56.760
Zhangrun, come catch me!

01:58.840 --> 02:00.350
The fireworks are so beautiful!

02:06.350 --> 02:07.200
See? If I do this,

02:07.200 --> 02:08.870
you can't catch me!

02:13.560 --> 02:14.630
Mother.

02:18.190 --> 02:20.000
Mother, I miss Father.

02:20.080 --> 02:21.880
The bad men have all been driven away.

02:21.896 --> 02:23.960
Why isn't Father back yet?

02:26.150 --> 02:27.710
My birthday is just over

02:27.870 --> 02:29.430
two months away.

02:29.624 --> 02:31.030
Father will surely be back by then

02:31.030 --> 02:32.750
to celebrate my birthday with me, right?

02:36.710 --> 02:38.710
Your father misses you both
very much too.

02:39.128 --> 02:41.030
I'm sure he'll come back
as soon as he can.

02:47.710 --> 02:48.960
On this Chinese New Year's Eve,

02:49.430 --> 02:50.470
your father won't be here,

02:51.150 --> 02:53.590
so you must stay up
with me to welcome the Chinese New Year.

02:54.310 --> 02:56.590
Later, we'll play Toss for Fortune.

02:56.632 --> 02:59.030
When the time comes,
we all have to put our strength into it

02:59.240 --> 03:01.000
so we'll gain a fortune

03:01.120 --> 03:02.360
and become rich.

03:02.840 --> 03:03.910
I want to Toss for Fortune!

03:03.910 --> 03:05.240
I want to get rich!

03:05.360 --> 03:06.520
I want to get rich, too!

03:07.710 --> 03:08.240
Come on.

03:12.240 --> 03:13.430
When the fifth watch comes,

03:13.960 --> 03:15.030
we'll take that

03:15.030 --> 03:16.630
door bolt tied with red silk

03:16.750 --> 03:18.240
and toss it high into the air.

03:18.360 --> 03:19.280
And we have to shout,

03:19.520 --> 03:21.870
"Let the cats come, let the dogs come!"

03:21.960 --> 03:24.710
- "May the God of Wealth come to our home!"
- "May the God of Wealth come to our home!"

03:24.808 --> 03:27.520
- "May big ingots roll right in!"
- "May big ingots roll right in!"

03:27.592 --> 03:31.750
- "May little ingots squeeze in through the cracks!"
- "May little ingots squeeze in through the cracks!"

03:32.430 --> 03:34.710
- "Let the cats come, let the dogs come!"
- "Let the cats come, let the dogs come!"

03:34.800 --> 03:37.560
- "May the God of Wealth come to our home!"
- "May the God of Wealth come to our home!"

03:37.624 --> 03:40.250
- "May big ingots roll right in!"
- "May big ingots roll right in!"

03:40.310 --> 03:43.430
- I'll toss mine the highest and get the richest!
- "May little ingots squeeze in through the cracks!"

03:43.630 --> 03:44.960
I'm taller than you.

03:44.960 --> 03:46.000
- And stronger than you!
- "Big ingots,"

03:46.000 --> 03:47.280
- I'll be the richest!
- "roll right in!"

03:47.368 --> 03:51.672
- "May little ingots squeeze in through the cracks!"
- "May little ingots squeeze in through the cracks!"

04:07.680 --> 04:08.750
It's snowing.

04:09.570 --> 04:12.430
It's snowing!

04:12.470 --> 04:14.310
A timely snow promises a bountiful year.

04:14.840 --> 04:17.390
May the harvest be plentiful
and bring us great fortune!

04:17.480 --> 04:20.040
May the harvest be plentiful
and bring us great fortune!

05:32.220 --> 05:36.900
(Emperor, formerly the Retired Emperor)

05:40.630 --> 05:41.800
It's already the Hour of Zi.

05:42.160 --> 05:43.830
Your Majesty, you should get some rest.

05:47.560 --> 05:48.430
Han Liang

05:49.040 --> 05:50.600
is still outside the Imperial Study?

05:51.250 --> 05:53.128
(Fourth-Rank Eunuch of the Directorate
of Imperial Regalia)

05:53.140 --> 05:54.820
Your Majesty hasn't allowed him
to leave,

05:54.830 --> 05:56.248
so naturally he doesn't dare leave.

05:56.430 --> 05:57.070
Back when

05:57.080 --> 05:59.160
Your Majesty had only just fallen
into Wona's hands,

05:59.270 --> 06:00.870
Han Liang was already in a great hurry

06:00.968 --> 06:02.648
to urge
the enthronement of a new emperor.

06:03.120 --> 06:05.360
That alone shows his disloyalty
to Your Majesty.

06:06.600 --> 06:08.600
Now, after overcoming every obstacle,

06:08.610 --> 06:10.120
Your Majesty has regained the throne,

06:10.310 --> 06:11.680
yet Han Liang remains unrepentant

06:11.784 --> 06:13.180
and instead criticizes Your Majesty

06:13.190 --> 06:14.552
for placing your trust
in eunuchs like us,

06:14.584 --> 06:16.120
who are utterly loyal to Your Majesty

06:16.136 --> 06:17.592
and would follow you even unto death.

06:18.480 --> 06:20.040
Your Majesty is far too merciful.

06:20.600 --> 06:22.390
You should make an example of him

06:22.600 --> 06:23.830
as a warning to others.

06:35.680 --> 06:36.720
Get some rest.

06:58.400 --> 07:05.170
♪Every word carries countless thoughts♪

07:05.950 --> 07:13.340
♪The encounters of half a lifetime
are kept within this little world♪

07:13.500 --> 07:20.400
♪Bit by bit,
the passing years become the preface♪

07:20.950 --> 07:23.380
♪The joys and sorrows of the past♪

07:23.380 --> 07:28.930
♪Quietly dwell here♪

07:29.300 --> 07:33.480
♪With my own hands and heart♪

07:33.480 --> 07:36.980
♪I write my name♪

07:37.360 --> 07:40.730
♪Through countless lines of ink♪

07:40.980 --> 07:44.230
♪Step by step toward the light♪

07:44.310 --> 07:48.540
♪With what I know and what I do♪

07:48.540 --> 07:51.740
♪I'll rewrite my fate♪

07:51.740 --> 07:54.220
♪The long night is almost over♪

07:54.220 --> 08:02.380
♪I won't dwell on the past anymore♪

08:24.190 --> 08:25.120
Who would dare

08:25.144 --> 08:26.856
build a snowman outside
the Imperial Study?

08:26.904 --> 08:28.000
Do they have a death wish?

08:30.390 --> 08:31.720
That's not a snowman.

08:57.150 --> 08:57.750
He's dead.

09:42.500 --> 09:54.540
♪Let's begin with the Zuo Commentary
on the Spring and Autumn Annals♪

09:54.840 --> 10:01.500
♪The late Emperor's successors rose
and shaped the realm♪

10:01.760 --> 10:13.080
♪How many emperors were wise,
and how many were foolish?♪

10:41.300 --> 10:44.460
(Six Months Later)

10:47.500 --> 10:52.940
(True Joy)

10:52.960 --> 10:53.840
I heard

10:54.030 --> 10:55.600
it wasn't just Minister Han who died.

10:56.670 --> 10:58.440
Several officials
who followed Minister Han

10:58.440 --> 11:00.136
in supporting the new emperor back then

11:00.440 --> 11:02.630
were also framed
by Eunuch Cao on various charges.

11:04.270 --> 11:05.550
Some were dismissed,

11:06.150 --> 11:07.600
while others were imprisoned.

11:12.630 --> 11:13.960
The emperor keeps changing.

11:15.120 --> 11:16.000
The capital

11:16.630 --> 11:17.670
is truly in chaos.

11:18.200 --> 11:19.790
Back then, I was so enthusiastic

11:20.150 --> 11:21.600
about urging Lanxiang and Suhua

11:21.600 --> 11:23.720
to buy land and houses in the capital.

11:24.360 --> 11:26.270
Thankfully, Lanxiang
had better judgment.

11:26.312 --> 11:28.230
Not only did she refrain
from buying any herself,

11:28.248 --> 11:30.140
but she also persuaded us
to abandon the idea.

11:30.150 --> 11:31.750
We just happened to avoid it.

11:38.360 --> 11:39.550
It's already June.

11:40.720 --> 11:42.120
As long as Jinqi isn't back,

11:42.630 --> 11:43.480
I can't

11:43.790 --> 11:44.910
rest easy.

11:48.790 --> 11:49.630
Aunt Lanxiang!

11:50.720 --> 11:51.510
Aunt Lanxiang!

11:56.500 --> 12:00.020
(Lin Zhangjun, 24 years old)
Uncle Jinqi is back.

12:03.688 --> 12:05.390
His Lordship has reached the wharf?

12:07.120 --> 12:07.870
Uncle Jinqi

12:08.008 --> 12:09.440
has already reached the side gate.

12:17.260 --> 12:19.840
♪The golden sunset♪

12:19.840 --> 12:22.940
♪Sketches my thoughts♪

12:26.440 --> 12:28.360
Look. Does this have three heads
and six arms?

12:28.510 --> 12:29.910
One, two, three?

12:30.840 --> 12:32.550
Father, this sword is so heavy,

12:32.910 --> 12:34.000
but I like it.

12:34.960 --> 12:36.080
Slow down, Zhangcheng.

12:37.544 --> 12:38.910
Didn't you miss your father?

12:39.220 --> 12:44.660
♪I wonder if
the past has ever been heard♪

12:47.640 --> 12:50.800
♪Yesterday's brush and ink♪

12:52.840 --> 12:53.150
Look.

12:54.360 --> 12:55.390
Mother is back.

12:57.320 --> 12:58.360
Mother, hurry!

13:01.560 --> 13:05.020
♪Love and guilt intertwine♪

13:05.420 --> 13:08.790
♪If the reflection isn't real,
what does it matter?♪

13:09.490 --> 13:14.580
♪I still remember your name♪

13:16.770 --> 13:19.360
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

13:19.360 --> 13:23.880
♪For withholding its light♪

13:26.120 --> 13:28.120
Mother, Father gave me this sword.

13:28.264 --> 13:30.072
He's going
to teach me swordsmanship, too.

13:30.910 --> 13:31.750
Be careful.

13:31.750 --> 13:32.790
Don't hurt anyone.

13:32.910 --> 13:33.320
All right.

13:33.384 --> 13:34.850
The blade hasn't been sharpened yet.

13:34.920 --> 13:36.720
Once Zhangcheng
has mastered swordsmanship,

13:37.030 --> 13:38.200
we'll have it sharpened.

13:40.104 --> 13:41.960
You've had a long journey,
Your Lordship.

13:45.390 --> 13:46.720
Go play with your sister.

13:47.200 --> 13:49.200
I want to play with Father.

13:53.816 --> 13:56.360
Father and Mother haven't seen
each other for over half a year.

13:56.390 --> 13:58.320
Why are you getting in the way?
Come with me.

13:59.000 --> 14:00.030
Father, Mother.

14:00.030 --> 14:00.440
Come on.

14:01.144 --> 14:02.728
I'll take you to play by the pond.

14:09.160 --> 14:12.310
♪Yesterday's brush and ink♪

14:12.310 --> 14:15.600
♪Lightly trace the cause and effect♪

14:16.740 --> 14:19.350
♪Half a lifetime of longing♪

14:19.350 --> 14:22.560
♪Returns to this moment♪

14:23.100 --> 14:26.240
♪Love and guilt intertwine♪

14:26.600 --> 14:27.630
I'm home.

14:31.320 --> 14:32.870
I've waited so long for you.

14:38.220 --> 14:40.760
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

14:40.760 --> 14:45.220
♪For withholding its light♪

14:45.780 --> 14:49.330
♪I only pray that those I've known♪

14:49.330 --> 14:53.130
♪Still live and thrive♪

14:53.380 --> 14:56.720
♪I no longer search through old dreams♪

14:56.880 --> 15:00.090
♪Leaving them buried
deep within the years♪

15:08.320 --> 15:09.240
Originally,

15:09.272 --> 15:11.288
I could've made it home
for the Chinese New Year.

15:12.910 --> 15:14.270
But at the time, we had to welcome

15:16.120 --> 15:17.200
His Majesty back,

15:19.240 --> 15:21.240
so I couldn't just leave.

15:21.720 --> 15:23.030
It would've seemed disrespectful.

15:24.720 --> 15:26.150
Later, I thought

15:27.240 --> 15:28.390
I could make it back

15:28.870 --> 15:30.550
for Zhangcheng's birthday.

15:31.630 --> 15:34.360
But then His Majesty reclaimed
the throne.

15:36.960 --> 15:39.200
I decided I had to leave no matter what.

15:40.720 --> 15:41.670
But then

15:43.240 --> 15:44.910
something happened to Minister Han.

15:48.440 --> 15:50.240
The Han family has few relatives.

15:51.030 --> 15:52.960
Madam Han was left alone
with her children.

15:55.000 --> 15:56.360
Minister Han and I

15:56.870 --> 15:59.030
were both disciples of Scholar Shouyi.

16:00.150 --> 16:01.790
I couldn't simply look the other way.

16:03.030 --> 16:04.480
So I made up my mind

16:05.270 --> 16:06.670
to escort Madam Han

16:07.120 --> 16:10.030
and Minister Han's coffin
back to Suzhou.

16:10.790 --> 16:12.910
We laid Minister Han
to rest in his ancestral grave.

16:14.344 --> 16:16.390
By the time
the funeral arrangements were complete,

16:17.360 --> 16:18.870
it was already this late.

16:24.840 --> 16:26.910
Will Madam Han and the children

16:27.080 --> 16:28.240
return to the capital?

16:29.440 --> 16:31.150
Madam Han is strong-willed.

16:32.030 --> 16:33.510
If she stays in the capital,

16:34.200 --> 16:35.030
I'm afraid

16:35.320 --> 16:37.870
she'll clash
with those eunuchs sooner or later.

16:39.910 --> 16:42.670
At the urging
of her sister and brother-in-law,

16:43.910 --> 16:46.000
Madam Han settled in Jinling.

16:47.240 --> 16:48.630
She now lives in

16:49.000 --> 16:51.670
Minister Han's former residence
on Wenchang Street.

16:53.630 --> 16:55.000
Back when Madam Han

16:55.200 --> 16:56.550
was still Young Lady Dong,

16:56.790 --> 16:58.270
she killed Dai Rui with her own hands

16:58.480 --> 16:59.630
and avenged her father.

17:00.240 --> 17:02.510
If she didn't have children now,

17:03.720 --> 17:05.590
I'm afraid she'd risk her own life

17:06.200 --> 17:07.680
to kill Eunuch Cao.

17:10.790 --> 17:12.000
Scholar Shouyi

17:12.680 --> 17:14.550
had already retired to his home,

17:15.830 --> 17:18.510
but when he heard that
his prized disciple had died unjustly,

17:19.440 --> 17:20.720
he was so shaken

17:21.510 --> 17:24.270
that he had his grandson carry him
from place to place,

17:25.240 --> 17:28.640
rallying renowned scholars
throughout Jiangnan

17:29.400 --> 17:31.350
to submit a memorial to His Majesty.

17:34.070 --> 17:35.870
It said that the founding Emperor

17:36.270 --> 17:38.550
had wrongfully condemned
Grand Secretary Shen and his sons

17:40.110 --> 17:41.400
and petitioned His Majesty

17:42.328 --> 17:45.208
to clear Grand Secretary Shen
and his family of all charges.

17:52.590 --> 17:53.750
The sages taught

17:54.360 --> 17:56.376
that a son should not speak
of his father's faults.

17:57.240 --> 17:59.680
Besides, during his reign,

17:59.704 --> 18:02.088
the founding Emperor was diligent
and incorruptible

18:02.568 --> 18:04.376
and was considered a wise ruler.

18:06.790 --> 18:08.920
That memorial won't be approved.

18:10.830 --> 18:12.110
His Majesty didn't approve it.

18:13.480 --> 18:14.310
However,

18:15.070 --> 18:16.720
after receiving the memorial,

18:17.590 --> 18:20.160
he released all the other officials

18:20.264 --> 18:22.056
who were being held
in the imperial prison.

18:28.030 --> 18:29.480
Scholar Shouyi

18:29.800 --> 18:31.656
saved them
by drawing attention elsewhere.

18:32.720 --> 18:34.110
He made those eunuchs

18:34.400 --> 18:35.680
wary of going too far.

18:36.200 --> 18:37.240
It's good to remind them

18:37.240 --> 18:39.160
that integrity still lives on

18:39.790 --> 18:40.960
in the written word.

18:49.800 --> 18:51.510
Petty disputes
can spiral out of control,

18:52.472 --> 18:54.310
just as
an anthill can bring down a dike.

19:01.720 --> 19:02.680
From now on,

19:05.350 --> 19:07.510
I'll stay by your side with the children

19:08.400 --> 19:09.790
and live a peaceful life.

19:16.640 --> 19:17.310
All right.

19:55.920 --> 19:56.550
Stop.

19:58.400 --> 19:59.270
Straighten your back.

20:02.880 --> 20:03.920
Look straight ahead.

20:05.400 --> 20:06.400
Raise your hand higher.

20:07.400 --> 20:09.240
Do you remember this move?

20:09.680 --> 20:10.510
I do.

20:20.030 --> 20:20.680
I'm not tired.

20:21.310 --> 20:22.440
Father, I'm not hot.

20:24.510 --> 20:25.160
Downward strike.

20:25.928 --> 20:26.790
Horizontal sweep.

20:27.160 --> 20:28.030
Turn and thrust.

20:28.344 --> 20:30.030
Do you remember what I just taught you?

20:30.400 --> 20:31.110
I do.

20:31.160 --> 20:31.720
Come on.

20:46.460 --> 20:49.060
(Lin Zhangcheng, 16 years old)

21:07.000 --> 21:07.510
Good.

21:07.928 --> 21:10.030
You're every bit
as good as I was at your age.

21:12.488 --> 21:14.000
Father, you're flattering me again.

21:17.480 --> 21:18.270
In this world,

21:18.776 --> 21:20.110
apart from a very small number

21:20.110 --> 21:21.720
of exceptionally gifted women,

21:22.270 --> 21:24.070
most women are naturally

21:24.310 --> 21:25.880
not as strong as men.

21:26.440 --> 21:27.440
If you can avoid a fight,

21:28.110 --> 21:29.110
then don't fight.

21:31.048 --> 21:32.904
The best strategy is to outthink
your enemy.

21:32.936 --> 21:34.808
The next best is
to win through diplomacy.

21:34.820 --> 21:36.552
Only after that
should you resort to force.

21:37.640 --> 21:38.720
Winning without bloodshed

21:39.440 --> 21:40.590
is the best course.

21:43.720 --> 21:44.270
So,

21:44.590 --> 21:45.750
Father, you mean

21:45.880 --> 21:47.200
I should learn more from Mother?

21:51.200 --> 21:52.720
I may be clever,

21:54.400 --> 21:55.350
but your mother

21:56.070 --> 21:57.240
is truly wise.

21:58.720 --> 22:00.440
Of course you should
learn more from her.

22:02.110 --> 22:03.070
I'll remember that.

22:09.350 --> 22:10.680
But once you do have to fight

22:12.310 --> 22:13.270
and draw your sword,

22:14.440 --> 22:15.880
you must show no mercy.

22:16.920 --> 22:18.000
Either you die

22:18.960 --> 22:20.000
or I live.

22:31.790 --> 22:32.590
Remember,

22:34.830 --> 22:35.830
your parents

22:38.070 --> 22:39.160
want you to live.

22:44.720 --> 22:45.680
I'll remember that.

22:45.920 --> 22:47.240
I would never dare make you grieve.

23:17.160 --> 23:18.510
It's getting late.

23:19.000 --> 23:21.000
I still have to hurry
to the Matchmaker Temple

23:21.110 --> 23:22.270
to offer incense.

23:28.216 --> 23:29.240
The Matchmaker Temple?

23:54.040 --> 23:55.030
Why are you still awake?

24:00.720 --> 24:01.270
Come.

24:02.520 --> 24:04.310
Sit with me for a while before we sleep.

24:30.400 --> 24:31.550
Zhangcheng said

24:32.640 --> 24:34.350
you went to the Matchmaker Temple today.

24:35.576 --> 24:37.528
Were you praying
for our son to find a match?

24:39.680 --> 24:41.720
Zhangrun is only thirteen.

24:42.830 --> 24:44.920
Isn't it a little early
to worry about that?

24:49.550 --> 24:50.550
I

24:54.240 --> 24:56.680
was praying for a match for myself.

24:58.920 --> 25:00.240
In our next life,

25:02.310 --> 25:04.790
I want us to be husband and wife again.

25:12.440 --> 25:14.640
The Matchmaker God
has already granted my wish.

25:58.510 --> 26:02.200
If I'd known I would marry you,

26:04.220 --> 26:05.960
I would've taken better care of myself

26:09.310 --> 26:11.640
back in Jinzhou.

26:24.200 --> 26:25.400
They say

26:27.920 --> 26:29.830
when no debts remain in this life,

26:30.920 --> 26:32.400
there will be no meeting in the next.

26:37.550 --> 26:39.920
I've thought
about it carefully for a long time.

26:44.680 --> 26:47.110
I owe you so much in this life.

26:57.680 --> 26:58.960
So in our next life,

27:01.750 --> 27:04.480
you must come find me
and make me repay you.

27:12.480 --> 27:14.510
If you don't come find me,

27:18.920 --> 27:21.350
I'll follow this red thread

27:22.270 --> 27:23.790
until I find you.

27:24.770 --> 27:27.110
No matter how fate entangles us,

27:28.350 --> 27:29.920
in the end,

27:34.310 --> 27:36.270
we're meant to be husband and wife.

27:49.000 --> 27:50.000
One lifetime

27:51.070 --> 27:52.030
is enough.

28:01.200 --> 28:03.640
We were brought together by fate.

28:16.030 --> 28:17.270
How could you

28:18.680 --> 28:20.310
not give yourself to save me?

28:27.160 --> 28:29.030
You're such a fool.

28:40.680 --> 28:42.980
♪Look at us♪

28:43.920 --> 28:46.340
♪We've shared
countless beautiful moments♪

28:46.350 --> 28:48.750
I've already made a deal
with the Matchmaker God.

28:50.830 --> 28:53.400
When I became engaged to my wife,

28:55.720 --> 28:57.590
her name was Shen Jialan.

29:01.030 --> 29:03.030
When I married her,

29:06.270 --> 29:08.080
her name was Xu Lanxiang.

29:08.080 --> 29:10.800
♪There will always be someone
to share it with♪

29:12.000 --> 29:14.110
The red thread

29:16.720 --> 29:19.400
has always bound me to the same person.

29:21.500 --> 29:25.260
♪Even if we must part in the end♪

29:27.240 --> 29:28.400
Please...

29:29.750 --> 29:30.920
Please...

29:33.400 --> 29:34.730
Please...

29:34.730 --> 29:37.630
♪Every sincerity you've shown me♪

29:38.110 --> 29:41.110
don't get it wrong...

29:41.590 --> 29:44.440
♪Our bond runs deep♪

29:45.270 --> 29:48.360
♪Binding us closely together♪

29:48.900 --> 29:51.550
♪After all
the questions life has brought♪

29:51.840 --> 29:56.000
♪This love has never faded
in the slightest♪

29:56.860 --> 30:00.310
♪A trace of fragrance lingers on♪

30:01.220 --> 30:04.300
♪How fortunate
to find one person in a lifetime♪

30:04.940 --> 30:06.500
♪Through the warm passing years♪

30:07.120 --> 30:12.960
♪My heart remains
as true to you as ever♪

30:40.680 --> 30:42.980
♪Look at us♪

30:43.920 --> 30:48.030
♪We've shared
countless beautiful moments♪

30:49.710 --> 30:54.720
♪Through life's winding road,
we've weathered countless trials♪

30:56.710 --> 31:03.440
♪I'm blessed to spend
each peaceful day and night with you♪

31:04.880 --> 31:07.520
♪However deep the joy or sorrow♪

31:08.130 --> 31:10.870
♪There will always be someone
to share it with♪

31:11.080 --> 31:14.200
♪Our bond runs deep♪

31:14.680 --> 31:17.980
♪Binding us closely together♪

31:18.460 --> 31:21.180
♪After all
the questions life has brought♪

31:21.350 --> 31:25.630
♪This love has never faded
in the slightest♪

31:26.400 --> 31:29.830
♪A trace of fragrance lingers on♪

31:30.660 --> 31:33.990
♪How fortunate
to find one person in a lifetime♪

31:34.420 --> 31:36.330
♪Through the warm passing years♪

31:36.580 --> 31:42.400
♪My heart remains
as true to you as ever♪

32:18.550 --> 32:24.160
♪Time unfurls a long scroll♪

32:24.700 --> 32:29.640
♪Flowers bloom
in turn as twilight falls♪

32:30.830 --> 32:36.230
♪Through rise and fall,
people meet and part as they always do♪

32:36.850 --> 32:42.510
♪Each plant endures its own trials
before reaching shore♪

32:42.920 --> 32:45.780
♪Flowers drift with the ties of fate♪

32:46.040 --> 32:49.100
♪Plum blossoms bloom,
enduring the frost♪

32:49.470 --> 32:54.860
♪Yet their proud spirit fades
with wind and snow♪

32:55.070 --> 32:58.070
♪Bamboo shadows
embrace quiet contentment♪

32:58.230 --> 33:01.170
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

33:01.580 --> 33:07.110
♪Watching the old and new
take turns in this world♪

33:07.110 --> 33:12.680
♪Spring comes,
and I smile upon a garden in full bloom♪

33:15.400 --> 33:16.310
Life is short.

33:16.590 --> 33:18.270
We should do what we love most

33:18.590 --> 33:20.000
to make this life worth living.

33:20.590 --> 33:23.440
I can write,
keep accounts, and run a business.

33:23.720 --> 33:25.680
Someday, I can be a shopkeeper myself.

33:26.350 --> 33:27.310
I'm the eldest sister.

33:27.320 --> 33:29.160
If anyone is to lead the way,
it should be me.

33:29.960 --> 33:31.440
I want to start over

33:31.550 --> 33:33.096
and live a better life than before.

33:33.400 --> 33:34.440
I hope

33:34.790 --> 33:36.440
you can all live better lives too.

33:37.510 --> 33:38.200
We

33:38.200 --> 33:39.920
should always hope

33:39.920 --> 33:41.736
that each year will be better
than the last.

33:41.790 --> 33:44.030
I learned to read and began studying.

33:44.120 --> 33:45.750
The road ahead grew wider and brighter.

33:46.110 --> 33:47.510
I will learn to ride a horse,

33:47.510 --> 33:48.590
travel far and wide,

33:49.030 --> 33:50.550
and see all the wonders of the land.

33:51.790 --> 33:53.720
I don't want to live in fear anymore.

33:54.350 --> 33:56.270
I want to live a life
of wealth and privilege.

33:56.510 --> 33:58.640
As long as my brother is safe

33:58.720 --> 34:00.070
and Mother is happy,

34:00.270 --> 34:01.750
I'll have everything I need.

34:01.860 --> 34:07.780
♪Each plant endures its own trials
before reaching shore♪

34:08.050 --> 34:10.790
♪Flowers drift with the ties of fate♪

34:11.080 --> 34:14.080
♪Plum blossoms bloom,
enduring the frost♪

34:14.360 --> 34:19.900
♪Yet their proud spirit fades
with wind and snow♪

34:21.800 --> 34:22.760
Great-Grandmother.

34:23.250 --> 34:26.290
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

34:26.610 --> 34:30.580
♪Watching the old and new
take turns in this world♪

34:30.580 --> 34:34.660
(Many Years Later)

34:37.464 --> 34:39.128
(Lin Zhihuan, 20 years old)
Great-Grandmother, why are you

34:39.160 --> 34:41.608
(Lanxiang's granddaughter)
here alone? Where are the maids?

34:42.030 --> 34:44.190
I wanted some time alone,

34:44.480 --> 34:46.400
so I sent them away.

34:48.480 --> 34:49.510
Let's go back.

35:02.880 --> 35:03.630
Take your time.

35:25.960 --> 35:26.670
Great-Grandmother,

35:27.590 --> 35:29.230
I've seen all the other plays.

35:29.840 --> 35:30.840
Why

35:31.510 --> 35:33.150
is every woman in these plays

35:33.760 --> 35:35.110
named Tanniang?

35:39.480 --> 35:44.360
"Tan" comes from the udumbara flower.

35:46.360 --> 35:48.360
The wondrous Dharma

35:49.000 --> 35:51.480
is like the udumbara flower,

35:52.030 --> 35:54.440
which appears only once
in a great while.

36:01.190 --> 36:02.800
There is a deeper meaning in the play.

36:02.824 --> 36:04.710
The listener must
discover it for themselves.

36:08.710 --> 36:09.960
"Tan"

36:10.760 --> 36:13.480
also evokes something fleeting
like the udumbara flower.

36:15.320 --> 36:16.190
In this world,

36:16.360 --> 36:18.590
how many women can soar away
like an eagle

36:18.590 --> 36:20.070
or become a female general?

36:20.550 --> 36:22.480
For most women,

36:23.070 --> 36:25.230
such things truly are like
a beautiful dream,

36:25.670 --> 36:27.190
as fleeting as the udumbara flower.

36:31.070 --> 36:33.400
The udumbara flower is rarely seen,

36:34.000 --> 36:34.630
but that

36:35.360 --> 36:37.630
doesn't mean it doesn't exist.

36:45.800 --> 36:47.030
Go on now.

36:56.300 --> 37:01.140
(Shen Lan, the youngest daughter,
brings honor to the Shen family.)

37:01.140 --> 37:05.752
(Cui Mei to her daughter and niece.
Daughters of the Shen family)

37:05.752 --> 37:09.580
(must be educated and well-mannered)

37:18.840 --> 37:20.030
(All these years,)

37:21.230 --> 37:24.150
(I've written play after play,)

37:26.440 --> 37:29.150
(telling every joy and sorrow
in women's lives.)

37:32.070 --> 37:33.150
(But in truth,)

37:34.800 --> 37:37.320
(when I first resolved to write plays,)

37:39.480 --> 37:42.110
(I only wanted to tell
the story of the Shen family.)

37:42.110 --> 37:43.420
(Remember the present...)

37:44.110 --> 37:45.280
(I wanted to write down)

37:45.760 --> 37:48.280
(those warm days I remembered)

37:50.190 --> 37:51.800
(so I would never forget them.)

37:51.800 --> 37:54.660
(Never forget...)

37:54.670 --> 37:55.360
(Later,)

37:56.110 --> 37:57.960
(I became driven by a greater purpose.)

37:57.960 --> 38:01.260
(Never forget the past.)

38:01.280 --> 38:03.760
(I wanted more than
for the Shen family to be remembered.)

38:05.110 --> 38:06.760
(I also wanted to clear the names)

38:07.400 --> 38:08.440
(of my grandfather,)

38:09.670 --> 38:10.590
(my grandmother,)

38:11.320 --> 38:12.360
(my father,)

38:13.510 --> 38:15.030
(and my mother.)

38:15.030 --> 38:20.420
(Walk this life once...)

38:20.760 --> 38:22.230
(The ruler guides his subjects.)

38:23.590 --> 38:24.880
(As subjects of the realm,)

38:25.840 --> 38:27.150
(whether we live or die,)

38:27.670 --> 38:29.230
(we can only endure.)

38:29.230 --> 38:31.230
(Only fools live in ignorance...)

38:31.230 --> 38:33.440
(But no matter
how high an emperor sits,)

38:34.630 --> 38:36.190
(he still eats the grain of the land,)

38:37.048 --> 38:38.880
(wears clothes woven
from mulberry and hemp,)

38:41.230 --> 38:43.070
(and is sustained by the people.)

38:47.760 --> 38:49.030
(As long as my plays)

38:49.800 --> 38:51.480
(continue to be sung among the people,)

38:52.536 --> 38:54.400
(the injustice suffered
by the Shen family)

38:55.030 --> 38:56.630
(will be remembered.)

38:57.660 --> 38:59.660
(The Shen Family Chronicle)

38:59.670 --> 39:01.190
(The glow of fireflies and stars)

39:02.670 --> 39:03.550
(can also)

39:04.360 --> 39:06.880
(reveal that justice
ultimately prevails.)

40:24.640 --> 40:27.540
♪The wind blows past distant hills♪

40:28.790 --> 40:31.740
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

40:32.860 --> 40:36.500
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

40:37.180 --> 40:39.920
♪Peace of heart in three places♪

40:40.810 --> 40:44.050
♪The years are calluses in our palms♪

40:45.200 --> 40:48.260
♪And the worries
etched between our brows♪

40:49.420 --> 40:53.410
♪Birds carry twigs into the distance♪

40:53.700 --> 40:56.800
♪While two pairs of eyes
watch from below♪

40:59.050 --> 41:02.900
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

41:02.900 --> 41:06.540
(The Shen Family Chronicle)

41:06.980 --> 41:09.180
(One hundred and thirteen years later,)

41:09.650 --> 41:14.390
(after repeated petitions initiated
by the people,)

41:14.980 --> 41:18.020
(the Emperor cleared Shen Qihan
and his sons of all charges,)

41:18.136 --> 41:20.120
(granted him
the posthumous title Wenqing,)

41:20.248 --> 41:23.220
(honored the women of the Shen family
for their virtue and fortitude,)

41:23.448 --> 41:25.830
(returned their remains
to their ancestral home for burial,)

41:26.190 --> 41:28.220
(and had a tomb
and memorial shrine built.)

41:28.900 --> 41:33.170
♪People gather, then part♪

41:34.580 --> 41:37.830
♪Regret is a letter wishing you well♪

41:39.030 --> 41:42.040
♪Yet a figure hobbles away♪

41:43.350 --> 41:47.450
♪Back home,
leaves fall upon the blue-tiled roofs♪

41:47.450 --> 41:51.260
♪Leaving only a little house behind♪

41:51.740 --> 41:55.820
(Upholding the Virtue
of Generations Past)

42:01.460 --> 42:03.140
(Bringing honor to the family name)

42:05.490 --> 42:09.280
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

42:09.780 --> 42:13.410
♪Snow hangs thick upon the eaves♪

42:13.950 --> 42:18.420
♪Four seasons
wax and wane, year after year♪

42:18.420 --> 42:21.440
♪Whose footsteps come and go?♪

42:22.340 --> 42:25.930
♪This side of the river is also a shore♪

42:26.340 --> 42:30.090
♪From this side of the mountain,
I miss you deeply♪

42:30.460 --> 42:34.980
♪Sweeping away the grass
before the door in April♪

42:35.380 --> 42:41.820
(Peace)

42:42.750 --> 42:46.380
♪The evening breeze
blows past distant hills♪

42:47.330 --> 42:50.480
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

42:50.940 --> 42:55.288
(Love given returns as love, and
blessings bestowed return as blessings.)

42:55.290 --> 43:00.340
(Jia Yi, New Writings:
Spring and Autumn, Han Dynasty)

43:00.820 --> 43:04.900
(The End)

43:20.140 --> 43:24.260
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

43:27.100 --> 43:31.620
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

43:32.900 --> 43:36.820
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

43:37.500 --> 43:40.260
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

43:40.980 --> 43:43.300
♪Though all the world may fade♪

43:43.300 --> 43:46.380
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

43:47.900 --> 43:52.140
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

43:55.060 --> 43:59.220
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:01.020 --> 44:04.580
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:04.580 --> 44:08.140
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:08.940 --> 44:14.620
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:14.980 --> 44:19.300
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:19.660 --> 44:22.620
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:22.620 --> 44:26.380
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

44:26.380 --> 44:29.260
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

44:29.260 --> 44:33.340
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

44:33.340 --> 44:36.700
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

44:36.700 --> 44:40.460
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

44:40.460 --> 44:44.460
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

44:45.220 --> 44:49.380
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:49.380 --> 44:52.820
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:52.820 --> 44:56.460
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

44:56.460 --> 44:59.340
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

44:59.340 --> 45:03.420
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:03.420 --> 45:06.780
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:06.780 --> 45:10.420
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:10.420 --> 45:18.220
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
